ouble tail spider on a dotted page","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":7,"title":"A Spider camouflaging on a bark","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":8,"title":"Moth on a dotted page","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":9,"title":"A Moth camouflaging on dry leaves","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":10,"title":"Gecko on a dotted page","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":11,"title":"A Gecko camouflaging on a bark","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":12,"title":"Grasshopper on a dotted page","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":13,"title":"A Grasshopper merging with leaves","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":14,"title":"Crab spider on a dotted page","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":15,"title":"A Crab spider eating a wasp","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":16,"title":"Owl on a dotted page","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":17,"title":"A Owl sitting on a branch","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":18,"title":"Planthopper on a dotted page","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":19,"title":"A Planthopper on dry leaves","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":20,"title":"Frog on a dotted page","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":21,"title":"A Frog on the ground","illustrator":"Karthikeyan S.","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-19"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":510},"text":["ದೊಡ್ಡ ಕಾಡಿನ ದಟ್ಟ ಮರಗಳ ನಡುವೆ ಹಾರುತ್ತಾ - ತೇಲುತ್ತಾ ನಾ ಖುಷಿಯಾಗಿರುವೆ. ಹಾರುವ ಹಾವುಗಳದ್ದೇ ಭಯ - ಅವು ನನ್ನ ನುಂಗಿಬಿಡಬಹುದು ಎಂದು!","ನಾನು ಹಾರುವ ಓತಿ.","ನಾನೆಲ್ಲಿರುವೆ ಬಲ್ಲೆಯಾ?"]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":510},"text":["ಮಿಂಚಿನ ಓಟದ ನನಗೆ, ಬಲು ನಾಚಿಕೆ.","ನನ್ನ ಹಿಕ್ಕೆಯೇ ನನ್ನ ಆಹಾರ! ಗೊತ್ತಾ?","ನಾನು ಕರಿಪಟ್ಟೆ ಯ ಮೊಲ.","ನಾನೆಲ್ಲಿರುವೆ ಬಲ್ಲೆಯಾ?"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":510},"text":["ನನ್ನ ದೇಹ ಪುಟ್ಟದು, ಕಾಲುಗಳು ಮಾತ್ರ ಮಾರುದ್ದ.","ಬಾಲವಂತೂ ವಿಚಿತ್ರ! ಮಧ್ಯದಲ್ಲೇ ಸೀಳಿ ಹೋಳಾದ ಹಾಗೆ!","ನಾನು ಜೋಡಿ ಬಾಲದ ಜೇಡ.","ನಾನೆಲ್ಲಿರುವೆ ಬಲ್ಲೆಯಾ?"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":510},"text":["ನಾನು ಎಲೆಯ ಕಸದ ಕೆಳಗೆ ಅಡಗಿರುವೆ .","ನನ್ನವು ವಿಶೇಷ ಮಾದರಿ ಯ ರೆಕ್ಕೆಗಳು !","ನಾನು ಚಿಟ್ಟೆ","ನನ್ನ ಹುಡುಕಬಲ್ಲಿರಾ?"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":510},"text":["ನಾನು ನನ್ನ ಇಡೀ ಜೀವನವನ್ನು ತೋಟದ ಮರಗಳ ಮೇಲೆಯೇ ಕಳೆಯುವೆ.","ಪುಟ್ಟ ಕೀಟಗಳು ಬಂದರೆ ಬಳಿಗೆ,","ಗಬಕ್ಕನೆ ಹಿಡಿದು ನುಂಗಿಯೇ ಬಿಡುವೆ ಹಾಗೇ…","ನಾನು ಮರ ಹಲ್ಲಿ.","ನಾನೆಲ್ಲಿರುವೆ ಪ ತ್ತೆ ಮಾಡಿ?"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":510},"text":["ರಸಭರಿತ ಹಸಿರು ಹುಲ್ಲೆಂದರೆ ಬಲು ಇಷ್ಟ ನನಗೆ.","ಚಿತ್ರವಿಚಿತ್ರ ಆಕಾರದ ಎಲೆಯೊಂದು ಕಂಡರೆ ನಿಮಗೆ, ಅದು ನಾನೇ!","ನಾನು ಹಸಿರು ಮಿಡತೆ.","ಹುಡುಕಿ ನೋಡೋಣ ನನ್ನ?"]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":510},"text":["ನನಗೆ ಎಂಟು ಕಾಲುಗಳಿವೆ ಆದರೆ ನಾನು ಜೇಡನಂತೆ ಬಲೆ ಹೆಣೆಯುವುದಿಲ್ಲ.","ನಾನು ನನ್ನದೇ ಬಣ್ಣದ ಹೂವುಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ವಾಸಿಸುತ್ತೇನೆ.","ನಾನು ಏಡಿ ಜೇಡ.","ನಾನೆಲ್ಲಿದ್ದೇನೆ ಹುಡುಕಿ?"]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":15,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p15.jpg","width":708,"height":510},"text":["ನಾನು ತಾಸುಗಟ್ಟಲೆ ಕದಲದೆ ಕೂರಬಲ್ಲೆ!","ಇಳಿಸಂಜೆ, ಮುಂಜಾನೆ ನನ್ನ ಕೀರಲು ಕೂಗು ಕೇಳಿ.","ನಾನು ಇ ರುಳುಗುರುಡು ಹಕ್ಕಿ.","ಹುಡುಕು ವಿರಾ ನನ್ನ?"]},{"n":16,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p16.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":17,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p17.jpg","width":708,"height":510},"text":["ನಾನು ಮುಂಗಾಲುಗಳನ್ನು ಎತ್ತಿ ಮಡಿಚಿದರೆ, ಪ್ರಾರ್ಥಿಸುತ್ತಿರುವಂತೆ ಕಾಣುತ್ತದೆ.","ಎಲೆಗಳು ನೇತಾಡುತ್ತಿವೆ ಎನಿಸಿದರೆ ಅದು ನಾನೇ!","ನಾನು ಸೂರ್ಯನ ಕುದುರೆ.","ಹುಡುಕಿ ನಾನು ಎಲ್ಲಿರುವೆ?"]},{"n":18,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p18.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":19,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p19.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ನಾನು ನೀರಿನ ಬಳಿಯಲ್ಲೇ ಸಾಕಷ್ಟು ಸಮಯ ಕಳೆಯುವೆ.","ನಿಮಗೆ “ಡ್ರೋಂಗ್…ಡ್ರೋಂಗ್…” ಎನ್ನುವ ನನ್ನ ಧ್ವನಿ ಕೇಳಿಸಿದರೆ ,","ಮಳೆಗಾಲ ಬಂತೆಂದೇ ಅರ್ಥ.","ನಾನು ದೊಡ್ಡಕಪ್ಪೆ.","ನಾನೆಲ್ಲಿದ್ದೇನೆ ಗೊತ್ತಾ?"]},{"n":20,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/31024-naanelliruve-huduki/p20.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]}],"wordCount":188}